Betty Trask Prize and Awards | Betty Trask Award | | |\\n| 2009 | The Rehearsal | Guardian First Boo\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eleanor_Catton\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d39\"},\"ref\":\"d39\",\"snippet\":\" ... About It - The Art, the Artists and the Racial Justice Movement on Madison's State Street | Third place |\\n\\nReferences\\n\\nExternal links\\n\\n* \\n\\nCategory:Awards established in 2007\\nCategory:2007 establishments in the United States\\nCategory:American non-fiction literary awards\\nCategory:American fiction awards\\nCategory:English-language literary awards\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Next_Generation_Indie_Book_Awards\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... A Russian version of the Booker Prize was created in 1992 called the Booker-Open Russia Literary Prize, also known as the Russian Booker Prize. In 2007, Man Group plc established the Man Asian Literary Prize, an annual literary award given to the best novel by an Asian ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d40\"},\"ref\":\"d40\",\"snippet\":\" ... Awards\\n\\nNOON stories have won numerous awards and prizes, including:\\n* Kim Chinquee's \\\"Formation\\\" - 2007 Pushcart Prize\\n* Christine Schutt's \\\"The Duchess of Albany\\\" - 2007 O. Henry Prize\\n* Clancy Martin's \\\"The Best Jeweler\\\" - 2008 Pushcart Prize\\n* Lydia Davis's \\\"We Had Wondered What Animal Might Arrive\\\" - 2009 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noon_(magazine)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"p