ishermen (2015), An Orchestra of Minorities (2019)\\n* José Eduardo Agualusa (Angola): Rainy Season, Creole, The Book of Chameleons, My Father's Wives\\n* Ama Ata Aidoo (Ghana): Our Sister Killjoy (1977), Changes: a Love ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/African_literature\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d53\"},\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... I, a great new African writer is asking these questions in a spare yet extraordinary novel about this bloody stain on human history.\\\"\\n\\n–Chigozie Obioma (The New York Times Book Review)\\n\\nFinalists:\\n\\nPeter Cameron, What Happens at Night (Catapult)\\n\\nAkwaeke Emezi, The Death of Vivek Oji (Riverhead)\\n\\nDanielle ... \",\"title\":\"https://lithub.com/the-award-winning-novels-of-2021/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d54\"},\"ref\":\"d54\",\"snippet\":\" ... Martin Literary Management and heads up adult fiction. Learn more.\\n\\nDigital media ventures\\n\\n- A new digital storytelling app, Alexander, focuses on shorts works by well-known authors. Alexander will launch with nonfiction works from authors such as Colum McCann, Xiaolu Guo, Chigozie Obioma, Carlo Rovelli, and Valeria Luiselli ... \",\"title\":\"https://janefriedman.com/new-publishers-agents-and-other-ventures-in-2020/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d55\"},\"ref\":\"d55\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Message List\\n\\nCatside Up, Catside Down: A Book of Prepositions by Anna Hrachovec\\n\\nCozy kitties in kooky situations are up, down, on, and around. Simple and hilarious, these gentle rhymes are a sure-fire hit. I am on board with this book because it is weird. It ... \",\"title\":\"https